WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.839 --> 00:00:06.599
[Spoiler Warning]
This is one of the most violent and ruthless

00:00:06.599 --> 00:00:08.269
pirates in all of One Piece.

00:00:08.269 --> 00:00:13.940
A man, who took out one of the four emperors
and exchanged blows with two more.

00:00:13.940 --> 00:00:19.650
This is someone who after two years in the
New World, has lost an arm but gained enormous

00:00:19.650 --> 00:00:21.449
power in return.

00:00:21.449 --> 00:00:26.539
While Luffy is going to face the mysterious
and destructive powers of Blackbeard as his

00:00:26.539 --> 00:00:31.630
biggest fight in the story yet, HE is bound
to take down his foil.

00:00:31.630 --> 00:00:32.630
Shanks.

00:00:32.630 --> 00:00:37.270
And, according to Eiichiro Oda himself, the
true reason that Kid wants to take down shanks

00:00:37.270 --> 00:00:40.070
is not related to losing his arm.

00:00:40.070 --> 00:00:45.460
Equipped with the frightening combination
of both, a devastating and fully awakened

00:00:45.460 --> 00:00:51.149
devil fruit AND the will of a conqueror, he
doesn't show mercy to his enemies, like these

00:00:51.149 --> 00:00:57.000
ones who he had crucified and disposed of,
as he is willing to do literally anything,

00:00:57.000 --> 00:01:02.399
even the most unthinkable things to get a
step closer to his ultimate goal.

00:01:02.399 --> 00:01:05.489
The throne of the pirate world.

00:01:05.489 --> 00:01:07.619
But then there is also this.

00:01:07.619 --> 00:01:10.109
The worries and love for a Nakama.

00:01:10.109 --> 00:01:13.110
Growing closer and fighting side by side with
Luffy.

00:01:13.110 --> 00:01:18.329
Until we actually see him cheering for Luffy
and trusting in his power.

00:01:18.329 --> 00:01:23.399
How do these two radically different traits
come together in the same person.

00:01:23.399 --> 00:01:29.329
Who is this man, that shares so many similarity
with the most mysterious and powerful characters

00:01:29.329 --> 00:01:30.579
in One PIece.

00:01:30.579 --> 00:01:34.179
His red hair, his missing arm, the scars over
his eyes.

00:01:34.179 --> 00:01:40.689
And what is his actual purpose as Luffy's
arguably most evil ally in the story?

00:01:40.689 --> 00:01:46.099
This gruesome depiction here is an illustration
of something that really happened.

00:01:46.099 --> 00:01:51.409
Because Captain Eustass Kid and his character
are inspired by the real life pirates Eustass

00:01:51.409 --> 00:01:54.110
the monk and Captain William Kid.

00:01:54.110 --> 00:01:57.079
The was latter was infamous for his cruelty.

00:01:57.079 --> 00:02:02.289
William Kid was the son of another famous
pirate, Captain John Kidd.

00:02:02.289 --> 00:02:09.470
And who knew, THIS elderly gentleman with
a very unhealthy complexion is actually the

00:02:09.470 --> 00:02:15.990
infamous captain John, former member of the
Rocks pirates and revived by Gecko Moria.

00:02:15.990 --> 00:02:23.049
And even though Kid looks a lot more like
another certain red head, it has been speculated

00:02:23.049 --> 00:02:29.560
that this guy right here might be a much more
likely candidate for Kid's father...that he

00:02:29.560 --> 00:02:30.980
never had.

00:02:30.980 --> 00:02:33.780
This also shows in his devil fruit powers.

00:02:33.780 --> 00:02:39.769
While Luffy is creative, flexible and funny,
like his rubbery sun god devil fruit, Kid's

00:02:39.769 --> 00:02:46.609
cold, iron-hard and edgy nature is wonderfully
embodied in his Jiki Jiki fruit, that not

00:02:46.609 --> 00:02:52.209
only looks absolutely fire, but is also ridiculously
powerful.

00:02:52.209 --> 00:02:57.099
Sadly we didn't get to see much of Kid's fighting
before Onigashima, especially this moment

00:02:57.099 --> 00:03:02.690
here, where he was ambushed by Kaido..god
I wish I'd get to see that.

00:03:02.690 --> 00:03:09.079
These panels during Onigashima however, DO
show us how his fruit truly works in its pure

00:03:09.079 --> 00:03:10.540
and awakened form.

00:03:10.540 --> 00:03:15.540
And so I feel like Eiichiro Oda, the Oda of
One PIece has made up for this.

00:03:15.540 --> 00:03:21.790
This here for example is Punk Clash, one of
Kid's strongest abilities, turning Big Mom

00:03:21.790 --> 00:03:28.239
into such a strong magnet, that even giant
steel-beams from the castle's wall crushed

00:03:28.239 --> 00:03:29.239
into her.

00:03:29.239 --> 00:03:35.370
While in his base form, Kid himself is magnetic,
his awakening allows him to assign magnetism

00:03:35.370 --> 00:03:38.170
to areas and objects that he touches.

00:03:38.170 --> 00:03:44.489
An extremely overpowered ability, as I think
Big Mom's defeat at Kid's and Law's hands

00:03:44.489 --> 00:03:46.620
more than clearly proves.

00:03:46.620 --> 00:03:51.370
I think when Eustass Kid introduces himself
to us for the very first time in the story,

00:03:51.370 --> 00:03:57.680
overseeing the terrible human action on Sabaody,
he also gives us the most important piece

00:03:57.680 --> 00:03:59.780
of information about himself.

00:03:59.780 --> 00:04:04.810
As he watches nobles and other people with
money and influence enter the auction house

00:04:04.810 --> 00:04:11.780
to buy people like property, he tells us exactly
what he thinks about this all.

00:04:11.780 --> 00:04:12.930
'World Nobles...

00:04:12.930 --> 00:04:13.930
Slaves...

00:04:13.930 --> 00:04:14.930
Human shops...

00:04:14.930 --> 00:04:18.820
Against the "purity" of these so-called nobles,
the villains of the world look positively

00:04:18.820 --> 00:04:20.150
humane in comparison.

00:04:20.150 --> 00:04:24.370
It's because the world's in the hands of scum
like them that it's all broken...

00:04:24.370 --> 00:04:28.790
I mean, we're not the nicest of guys, but
at least we're honest about it.'

00:04:28.790 --> 00:04:35.060
Kid is very much aware that he is not exactly
on the jolly side of piracy like Luffy is.

00:04:35.060 --> 00:04:39.790
He knows very well that the things he does
are terrible.

00:04:39.790 --> 00:04:46.759
However if he sees himself down here on the
moral ladder, the people who rule this world

00:04:46.759 --> 00:04:53.199
are not only 5 levels below him, but also
responsible for people like him to become

00:04:53.199 --> 00:04:56.389
this twisted and cruel in the first place.

00:04:56.389 --> 00:05:00.610
And I believe, this is also how we tend to
see kid as well.

00:05:00.610 --> 00:05:08.110
A much darker version of Luffy, who is willing
to do messed-up things, extremely messed up

00:05:08.110 --> 00:05:09.110
things.

00:05:09.110 --> 00:05:13.810
But at the same time, it seems pretty clear
that he also is fighting for a world without

00:05:13.810 --> 00:05:20.569
the government or at least a world where he
can be free from them, just like Luffy.

00:05:20.569 --> 00:05:25.080
And that's exactly the main point of his character.

00:05:25.080 --> 00:05:29.831
What I find beyond interesting, is that Eustass
Kid doesn't only play the contrasting character

00:05:29.831 --> 00:05:33.310
for one, but TWO people in the story.

00:05:33.310 --> 00:05:38.620
This is Kid's giant magnetic arm next to Luffy's
gear third.

00:05:38.620 --> 00:05:43.710
Here are Luffy and Kid having a competition
about literally anything in Udon prison.

00:05:43.710 --> 00:05:45.069
Who can carry the most.

00:05:45.069 --> 00:05:46.520
Who can eat the most.

00:05:46.520 --> 00:05:49.490
Who can make Queens eyes bulge the most.

00:05:49.490 --> 00:05:56.300
And this is Kid, just like Luffy, beaten by
Kaido in a cell, but refusing to give up.

00:05:56.300 --> 00:05:59.520
They hate nothing more than losing.

00:05:59.520 --> 00:06:04.990
Both on Sabaody and on Wano, we see Luffy
and Kidd storming on ahead, witch Law trying

00:06:04.990 --> 00:06:08.760
to reign them in and protect their backs form
any threat.

00:06:08.760 --> 00:06:15.319
And not for nothing has Kid always been portrayed
as the straw hat's number one rival amongst

00:06:15.319 --> 00:06:19.550
the supernova for becoming king of the pirates.

00:06:19.550 --> 00:06:22.440
But what’s the deal with him and shanks?

00:06:22.440 --> 00:06:27.050
Ohh, i left you on a cliff hanger there on
purpose, because first we need to talk about

