00:07:23.379 --> 00:07:29.100
A very popular saying you might have come
across somewhere before is that Kidd is Luffy

00:07:29.100 --> 00:07:30.599
without the plot armour.

00:07:30.599 --> 00:07:37.379
And even though I don't really like that term,
because plot armour is just plot, I agree

00:07:37.379 --> 00:07:39.949
with the idea behind this.

00:07:39.949 --> 00:07:45.810
On the plus side, Kid is Luffy but not bound
to the classic moral standards of a Shounen

00:07:45.810 --> 00:07:46.970
hero.

00:07:46.970 --> 00:07:54.729
He loves his crew like Luffy, but towards
anyone else he is just straight out cruel.

00:07:54.729 --> 00:08:01.530
And he can use any means possible to get stronger
and achieve his dream, without Oda-sensei

00:08:01.530 --> 00:08:05.979
having to worry about the message to his audience.

00:08:05.979 --> 00:08:12.479
On the down side however, not being Luffy
means that Kid also doesn't share his ability

00:08:12.479 --> 00:08:16.880
to create allies that help him become stronger.

00:08:16.880 --> 00:08:22.650
Instead of being trained by Reighleigh for
2 years, he directly marches into the New

00:08:22.650 --> 00:08:26.110
world, where he almost loses his life to Shanks.

00:08:26.110 --> 00:08:28.090
Oh yeah Shanks.

00:08:28.090 --> 00:08:31.580
Missing arm, scar over the eye, red hair.

00:08:31.580 --> 00:08:37.860
No coincidence, because this is the second
character that Kidd is a foil to.

00:08:37.860 --> 00:08:43.510
Think about it: Shanks sacrificed an arm to
inspire Luffy to become a pirate, while taking

00:08:43.510 --> 00:08:49.640
an arm from Kid, who for some mysterious reason
is obsessed with him.

00:08:49.640 --> 00:08:55.560
While Shanks doesn't mind having one arm,
Kid feels the need to replace his with his

00:08:55.560 --> 00:09:00.900
devil fruit power, though I honestly do fully
understand that.

00:09:00.900 --> 00:09:07.340
The main point of comparison between this
YOnko and this supernova however, is how they

00:09:07.340 --> 00:09:10.150
deal with people who laugh at them.

00:09:10.150 --> 00:09:16.811
As you well know, in chapter one, just after
Luffy ate his mythical Zoan devil fruit, Shanks

00:09:16.811 --> 00:09:20.910
calmly takes a beating by Higuma and his mountain
bandits.

00:09:20.910 --> 00:09:25.630
Something that Luffy imitates on Jaya with
Bellamy.

00:09:25.630 --> 00:09:31.940
If you're curious why that was such a big
deal, I made a whole video about that scene

00:09:31.940 --> 00:09:33.560
with Bellamy and Blackbeard.

00:09:33.560 --> 00:09:40.690
The point is, Kidd behaves, well just like
a kid, just like kid Luffy, he punishes and

00:09:40.690 --> 00:09:46.070
kills those who dare to laugh at his dreams,
while Luffy and Shanks pity those without

00:09:46.070 --> 00:09:50.440
a dream and don't see them as worthy opponents.

00:09:50.440 --> 00:09:55.300
In other words, Kid quite literally to his
name, needs to grow up.

00:09:55.300 --> 00:10:00.240
Which, as we will see in a second, he has
been doing during the wano arc.

00:10:00.240 --> 00:10:05.130
Now, I recently bought the 14th volume of
the official One PIece magazine, fittingly

00:10:05.130 --> 00:10:10.010
enough titled rivals by the way, that had
a massive character discussion section about

00:10:10.010 --> 00:10:12.890
Kid, that helped me a lot with this analysis.

00:10:12.890 --> 00:10:15.880
Finally all that Japanese study is coming
in handy.

00:10:15.880 --> 00:10:21.330
The main theme of Kid and his crew is literally
that of rebels, of being anti-establishment.

00:10:21.330 --> 00:10:27.560
While Kid obviously has a strong steam-punk-heavy
metal theme going on himself with, just look

00:10:27.560 --> 00:10:31.860
at this attack and those goggles.

00:10:31.860 --> 00:10:38.240
And I mean the ship is just awesome, by far
my favorite design in the entire story.

00:10:38.240 --> 00:10:44.180
It's called the victoria punk and has this
giant skull as its bow.

00:10:44.180 --> 00:10:49.830
And funnily enough, apart from kid and his
childhood friend Killer, the name of every

00:10:49.830 --> 00:10:54.900
of his crew members is based on famous rock
bands or other music terms.

00:10:54.900 --> 00:11:00.070
Heat, who can literally breathe fire, is based
on this Swedish band.

00:11:00.070 --> 00:11:02.650
This is wire, named after the English rock
band.

00:11:02.650 --> 00:11:10.210
There are also house, boogie and my two favorite
Nakama hip and hop, who I think have the most

00:11:10.210 --> 00:11:15.730
most awesome and most lazy names in all of
One Piece at the same time.

00:11:15.730 --> 00:11:20.710
The second and much more hidden theme in the
crew is something I would have never guessed

00:11:20.710 --> 00:11:21.710
though honestly.

00:11:21.710 --> 00:11:25.000
The kid pirates are also hippies.

00:11:25.000 --> 00:11:26.190
Look at this:

00:11:26.190 --> 00:11:28.330
killers pants or heat's outfit.

00:11:28.330 --> 00:11:31.520
You can't unsee it once you know.

00:11:31.520 --> 00:11:37.120
And to me it really nicely reflects these
two sides of kid himself, the rough and edgy

00:11:37.120 --> 00:11:41.700
together with this sort-of kind, fun and peaceful
side of him.

00:11:41.700 --> 00:11:46.100
A fun little story I discovered in the magazine
as well, is that Kid and killer are not only

00:11:46.100 --> 00:11:51.290
best childhood friends form the south blue,
but they also had the same childhood crush,

00:11:51.290 --> 00:11:57.250
that spilled a bowl of Udon over herself,
which is why it now is both of their least

00:11:57.250 --> 00:12:02.450
favorite foods, which is a hilarious little
pun Oda-sensei has made, because both Kid

00:12:02.450 --> 00:12:05.040
and Killer were held captive in Udon Prison.

00:12:05.040 --> 00:12:10.000
But I also think that it once again hints
at Kid's kinder and more caring side.

00:12:10.000 --> 00:12:13.610
I kind of side-tracked there for a second,
but I'm convinced that we got all of these

00:12:13.610 --> 00:12:20.740
little details, because they help illustrate
who Kid truly is as a character.

00:12:20.740 --> 00:12:25.680
Kid clearly has suffered through a lot of
trauma and pain throughout his life.

00:12:25.680 --> 00:12:33.270
This is him as a kid, clearly growing up in
a harsh environment.

00:12:33.270 --> 00:12:38.930
According to Oda-sensei, Kid's most important
principal in life is having no concern for

00:12:38.930 --> 00:12:41.040
anyone but his Nakama.

00:12:41.040 --> 00:12:46.310
In other words for those he trusts, Kid would
do anything, something he proves to us with

00:12:46.310 --> 00:12:51.980
his reaction when he finds out that Killer
had been forced to eat a smile devil fruit.

00:12:51.980 --> 00:12:58.520
Clearly it is really hard for Kid to build
trust with others.

00:12:58.520 --> 00:13:04.910
Which really hits home the one time we see
him grudgingly forming an alliance with Apoo

00:13:04.910 --> 00:13:09.820
and Hawkins, only to be betrayed right away.

00:13:09.820 --> 00:13:15.500
So when you look at this Kid at the beginning
of wano, angry and distrusting vs this kid

00:13:15.500 --> 00:13:20.880
right here, thrilled with the joy of battle
and trusting in Luffy to take down Kaido 1

00:13:20.880 --> 00:13:25.540
vs 1, damn girl, what a glow-up.

00:13:25.540 --> 00:13:29.940
He only joins the raid because he wants revenge
on Kaido in the first place, kind-of tagging

00:13:29.940 --> 00:13:32.490
along, while still doing his own thing.

00:13:32.490 --> 00:13:37.960
Like 'I'm not part of your alliance, but I
guess you will lose without me, so I'll come'.

00:13:37.960 --> 00:13:39.840
Strong Tsundere vibes from Kid here.

00:13:39.840 --> 00:13:45.250
I think spending time with Luffy in Udon definitely
was the basis for him even tagging along in

00:13:45.250 --> 00:13:46.540
the first place.

00:13:46.540 --> 00:13:50.550
But he is the one who will take down Kaido.

00:13:50.550 --> 00:13:57.280
THIS here however is the first change of character
however, as he sees Zoro heroically risking

00:13:57.280 --> 00:14:01.800
his own life for everyone else on the roof.

00:14:01.800 --> 00:14:06.070
That's not something a traitor would do.

00:14:06.070 --> 00:14:11.420
Over the course of the fight, Kid sees the
true nature of Luffy, Zoro and Law and while

00:14:11.420 --> 00:14:18.430
he keeps arguing with them, he more and more
integrates as part of the team.

00:14:18.430 --> 00:14:23.380
He counts on Law to have his back and starts
coordinating his attacks with him and Luffy.

00:14:23.380 --> 00:14:29.610
Finally, when Big Mom reappears, he focuses
on separating the two yonko's now fully believing

00:14:29.610 --> 00:14:32.630
in Luffy and acknowledging his powers.

00:14:32.630 --> 00:14:39.100
I think it's more than likely that Kid might
accompany Luffy to THIS island, where Shanks

00:14:39.100 --> 00:14:42.970
is waiting and confront him there.

00:14:42.970 --> 00:14:48.830
Because, Elbaf has been been foreshadowed
as the next major arc in the story.

00:14:48.830 --> 00:14:52.470
And so if you want to know all the crazy events
that might await Kid and Luffy on the island

00:14:52.470 --> 00:14:57.890
of the giants, you really should watch this
video here next and see what the story has

00:14:57.890 --> 00:14:58.890
in store for them.

00:14:58.890 --> 00:15:03.170
I really hope you enjoyed this video, and
I see you in the next one.

